Team2-api-data — central integration patch (slices 2a, 3, 4a)

Applies to /root/saas-rust (branch master). Apply from the repository root:

    git apply --check team2-api-data-central-20261031.patch
    git apply       team2-api-data-central-20261031.patch

WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
  The per-slice central patches published in the individual handoff notes are
  prose-oriented and cannot be applied mechanically as written:

  1. Slice 2a (site-analytics-api) and slice 4a (stream-timeline-data) both
     insert a Cargo.toml feature line at the SAME anchor (after
     `api-validation-route = [...]`). Each hunk's context is broken by the
     other hunk's insertion, so NEITHER ordering applies cleanly.
  2. Slice 3's Cargo.toml and schemas/mod.rs hunk headers carry context counts
     that do not match the lines in their hunks, which makes them
     arithmetically corrupt for `git apply`.
  3. Slice 2a's lib.rs hunk is expressed with a section heading instead of an
     explicit context block, and its line offsets are stale.

  This file is the merged, conflict-free, count-correct equivalent of all three.
  The per-slice notes stay the narrative source of truth for WHAT each line
  does; this file is the machine-appliable form.

VERIFIED BEFORE PUBLISHING
  - Every hunk header count matches the lines actually present in its hunk.
  - `git apply --check` exits 0 against the current master tree for all four
    files. This was a READ-ONLY validation: the patch was NOT applied and the
    central files are unmodified in the working tree.
  - Each insertion anchor was confirmed unique in its target file.
  - Every referenced Cargo feature and optional dependency was confirmed to
    exist in dimabot/Cargo.toml before this patch was written:
    api-admin, mongo, redis, logger-redis, ordinary-application-schemas,
    domain-event-runtime, twitch-client, twitch-streamers, eventsub,
    bson-js-json, application-schemas, cron-queue, twitch-headers, logger,
    and the optional deps serde_json + sha2.
  - No `[[test]]` entry is required: the suites self-gate with
    `#![cfg(feature = "...")]`.

FILES TOUCHED BY THIS PATCH
  dimabot/Cargo.toml            3 new feature lines
  dimabot/src/lib.rs            1 new module (site_route)
  dimabot/src/schemas/mod.rs    3 new schema modules
  dimabot/src/utils/mod.rs      5 new modules

